    <!-- Army Hospital Information SYstem -->
    <section id="call-to-action" class="call-to-action section light-background">

      <div class="container" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">

        <div class="hero-content">
          <div class="row align-items-center">

            <div class="col-lg-6">
              <div class="content-wrapper" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
                <h1>Led by an Expert Who Built Sri Lanka’s First Geographically Connected Army Hospital Information System</h1>
                <p>DocPP is built on the expertise of a retired healthcare IT professional who developed and successfully implemented the Army Hospital Information System. With over a decade of hands-on experience in designing and deploying clinical management systems tailored for Sri Lankan healthcare professionals, he has shaped DocPP into a reliable, practical, and future-ready solution. Watch the short video below to see how the Army Hospital Information System inspired the foundation of DocPP.</p>

                
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-6">
              <div class="image-container" data-aos="fade-left" data-aos-delay="300">
               <iframe width="100%" height="480" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/RKFGfiyvhlI?si=1O5ObwEc4D60bzEF" title="Army Hospital Information System" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </section><!-- /Army Hospital Information System -->
	 
	 

	 
	 
    <!-- Home About Section -->
    <section id="home-about" class="home-about section">

      <div class="container" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">

        <div class="row align-items-center">
          <div class="col-lg-6 mb-5 mb-lg-0" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-delay="200">
            <div class="about-content">
              <h2 class="section-heading">DocPP Clinical Management System — Live Demonstration for Sri Lankan Doctors</h2>
              <p class="lead-text" align="justify">This recorded live demonstration (2022) showcases DocPP’s core features — from patient registration and prescription management to appointment scheduling and reporting — giving doctors and clinic administrators a clear view of how to integrate DocPP into their own practice.</p>

              <p>Since then, DocPP has continued to evolve, introducing advanced modules such as AI-powered Patient Overview and intelligent workflow enhancements — while keeping the same reliability and simplicity demonstrated here.</p>

              <p><strong>Ideal for:</strong></p>
				<p>General practitioners and medical officers in Sri Lanka <br/>
				    Clinic managers and administrators looking to digitize their workflows<br/>
					Healthcare IT professionals exploring local clinical software solutions</p>
