 .sp-testimonial-client-name::before { display: none;}.tfree-card-footer { margin-top: 0px; padding-top: 5px; border-top: 0px solid rgba(17, 24, 39, .08);}/* Compact on small screens */@media (max-width: 480px){ .tfree-card-footer{ padding-top: 0px; gap: 12px; } .tfree-avatar img{ width: 48px !important; height: 48px !important; } .tfree-meta .sp-testimonial-client-name, .tfree-meta .sp-testimonial-name, .tfree-meta .tfree-client-name{ font-size: 15px; } .tfree-meta .sp-testimonial-client-designation, .tfree-meta .sp-testimonial-designation, .tfree-meta .tfree-client-designation{ font-size: 13px; }}</style><div class="sp-testimonial-item swiper-slide"><div class="sp-testimonial-free"><div class="sp-testimonial-client-testimonial"><div class="sp-testimonial-content"><p>Stock runouts used to be a nightmare — we would only realize when a patient’s prescription couldn’t be filled. With DocPP’s inventory alerts and reorder notifications, we stay ahead of low-stock items. The integration between prescriptions and our pharmacy module means fewer errors and quicker dispensing. It’s become indispensable for us.</p></div></div><div class="tfree-card-footer"> <div class="tfree-avatar"> <div class="sp-testimonial-client-image"><img width="227" height="235" src="https://healthcare.lk/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Screenshot-2025-10-07-133544.png" class="tfree-client-image wp-post-image" alt="" /></div> </div> <div class="tfree-meta"> <h4 class="sp-testimonial-client-name">Ms. Anjali Sen</h4> <div class="sp-testimonial-client-designation">Head Pharmacist, Harmony Care Clinic, Galle</div> </div></div></div> </div> <style>/* ===== LAYOUT (grid when not using slider) ===== */.sp-testimonial-grid,.sp-testimonial-wrapper,.sp-testimonial-section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 28px;}/* ===== CARD ===== */.sp-testimonial-item { background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.06);}.sp-testimonial-item .sp-testimonial-free { 