	 </div>
	 </section>
	 
   <section id="find-a-doctor" class="find-a-doctor section">

      <!-- Section Title -->
      <div class="container section-title" data-aos="fade-up">
        <h2>Questions & Answers</h2>
        <p>Quick Answers to Common Questions</p>
      </div><!-- End Section Title -->

      <div class="container aos-init aos-animat" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">

        <div class="doctors-grid aos-init aos-animate" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
			<style type="text/css"></style><section id='' 
                class='helpie-faq accordions faq-toggle open-first groupSettings-7__enabled' 
                data-collection='' 
                data-pagination='0' 
                data-search='0' 
                data-pagination-enabled='0'
                role='region'
                aria-label='FAQ Section'
                aria-live='polite'><article class="accordion "><div class='helpie-faq-row'><div class='helpie-faq-col helpie-faq-col-12' ><ul><li class="accordion__item "><div class="accordion__header " 
                id="accordion-header-post-151"
                role="button"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="accordion-content-post-151"
                data-id="post-151" 
                data-item="hfaq-post-151" 
                style="background:transparent;" 
                data-tags=""
                tabindex="0"><div class="accordion__title">There are free EMR systems. But you don’t offer a free one. Why?</div></div><div id="accordion-content-post-151" 
                class="accordion__body" 
                role="region"
                aria-labelledby="accordion-header-post-151"
                style="background:transparent;"><p data-renderer-start-pos="199">It’s true that some providers claim to offer <strong data-renderer-mark="true">free EMR (Electronic Medical Records) systems</strong>. However, most of these solutions are either unsafe, unstable, or unsustainable. Many so-called free EMR platforms:</p>
<ul class="ak-ul" data-indent-level="1">
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="409">Collect and analyse your <strong data-renderer-mark="true">patient data</strong> without proper security.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="475">Lack strong <strong data-renderer-mark="true">privacy protection</strong> or compliance with healthcare data standards.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="555">Shut down after a few months, causing you to lose all <strong data-renderer-mark="true">patient records and clinical history</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="650">Running a reliable <strong data-renderer-mark="true">EMR software solution</strong> requires continuous development, hosting, and security maintenance. If a provider isn’t charging, they are often earning ROI from your data or cutting corners. At DocPP, we prioritise <strong data-renderer-mark="true">data security, system reliability, and long-term sustainability</strong>—that’s why we don’t offer a “free forever” plan.</p>
</div></li><li class="accordion__item "><div class="accordion__header " 
                id="accordion-header-post-152"
                role="button"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="accordion-content-post-152"
                data-id="post-152" 
                data-item="hfaq-post-152" 
                style="background:transparent;" 
                data-tags=""
                tabindex="0"><div class="accordion__title">Do you offer a free trial period?</div></div><div id="accordion-content-post-152" 
                class="accordion__body" 
                role="region"
                aria-labelledby="accordion-header-post-152"
                style="background:transparent;"><p data-renderer-start-pos="1025">Yes. We provide a <strong data-renderer-mark="true">14-day free trial</strong> of the complete DocPP system. During this time, you can:</p>
<ul class="ak-ul" data-indent-level="1">
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="1121">Run your <strong data-renderer-mark="true">private practice</strong> without limitations.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="1171">Add your own <strong data-renderer-mark="true">drugs, treatment records, and clinical data</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="1232">Experience the <strong data-renderer-mark="true">full features of our EMR platform</strong> risk-free.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</div></li><li class="accordion__item "><div class="accordion__header " 
                id="accordion-header-post-153"
                role="button"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="accordion-content-post-153"
                data-id="post-153" 
                data-item="hfaq-post-153" 
                style="background:transparent;" 
                data-tags=""
                tabindex="0"><div class="accordion__title">How can I renew the system?</div></div><div id="accordion-content-post-153" 
                class="accordion__body" 
                role="region"
                aria-labelledby="accordion-header-post-153"
                style="background:transparent;"><p>Renewal is fully <strong data-renderer-mark="true">automated</strong>. You can use any <strong data-renderer-mark="true">Sri Lankan online payment method</strong> (Visa, MasterCard, internet banking, mobile wallets, etc.). Once payment is completed, your <strong data-renderer-mark="true">DocPP subscription</strong> is instantly updated with no downtime.</p>
</div></li><li class="accordion__item "><div class="accordion__header " 
                id="accordion-header-post-179"
                role="button"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="accordion-content-post-179"
                data-id="post-179" 
                data-item="hfaq-post-179" 
                style="background:transparent;" 
                data-tags=""
                tabindex="0"><div class="accordion__title">What is your technical stack?</div></div><div id="accordion-content-post-179" 
                class="accordion__body" 
                role="region"
                aria-labelledby="accordion-header-post-179"
                style="background:transparent;"><p data-renderer-start-pos="1585">Our <strong data-renderer-mark="true">healthcare software</strong> has been in the industry for over <strong data-renderer-mark="true">12 years</strong>, trusted by hundreds of medical professionals. In 2022, we completely revamped the platform using the <strong data-renderer-mark="true">latest PHP 8.x framework</strong>, ensuring:</p>
<ul class="ak-ul" data-indent-level="1">
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="1793">High-level <strong data-renderer-mark="true">security updates</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="1825">Greater <strong data-renderer-mark="true">system scalability and performance</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="1872">Long-term adaptability for new healthcare technology needs.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</div></li><li class="accordion__item "><div class="accordion__header " 
                id="accordion-header-post-180"
                role="button"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="accordion-content-post-180"
                data-id="post-180" 
                data-item="hfaq-post-180" 
                style="background:transparent;" 
                data-tags=""
                tabindex="0"><div class="accordion__title">Where is my data hosted?</div></div><div id="accordion-content-post-180" 
                class="accordion__body" 
                role="region"
                aria-labelledby="accordion-header-post-180"
                style="background:transparent;"><p>Your data is protected with <strong data-renderer-mark="true">enterprise-grade AWS security</strong>. We use <strong data-renderer-mark="true">dedicated, non-shared servers</strong> to keep your <strong data-renderer-mark="true">patient records, prescriptions, and medical histories</strong> safe, private, and compliant with healthcare security standards.</p>
</div></li><li class="accordion__item "><div class="accordion__header " 
                id="accordion-header-post-181"
                role="button"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="accordion-content-post-181"
                data-id="post-181" 
                data-item="hfaq-post-181" 
                style="background:transparent;" 
                data-tags=""
                tabindex="0"><div class="accordion__title">Can I lose my data? What about data recovery?</div></div><div id="accordion-content-post-181" 
                class="accordion__body" 
                role="region"
                aria-labelledby="accordion-header-post-181"
                style="background:transparent;"><p>No. DocPP has a <strong data-renderer-mark="true">comprehensive disaster recovery system</strong> in place. We perform <strong data-renderer-mark="true">regular encrypted backups</strong> and maintain <strong data-renderer-mark="true">redundant storage mechanisms</strong> to ensure that your <strong data-renderer-mark="true">patient data is never lost</strong>—even in the event of system failure.</p>
</div></li><li class="accordion__item "><div class="accordion__header " 
                id="accordion-header-post-182"
                role="button"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="accordion-content-post-182"
                data-id="post-182" 
                data-item="hfaq-post-182" 
                style="background:transparent;" 
                data-tags=""
                tabindex="0"><div class="accordion__title">Why should I choose DocPP over other EMR systems?</div></div><div id="accordion-content-post-182" 
                class="accordion__body" 
                role="region"
                aria-labelledby="accordion-header-post-182"
                style="background:transparent;"><p data-renderer-start-pos="2521">DocPP is a <strong data-renderer-mark="true">Sri Lankan-built EMR solution</strong> designed specifically for <strong data-renderer-mark="true">local healthcare practices</strong>. Unlike generic international software, DocPP is:</p>
<ul class="ak-ul" data-indent-level="1">
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="2668"><strong data-renderer-mark="true">Tailored for Sri Lankan doctors and clinics</strong> (support for local drug databases, workflows, and payment methods).</p>
</li>
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="2783">Backed since <strong>2008 (nearly 2 decades of real-world use</strong> and continuous upgrades.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="2849">Hosted on <strong data-renderer-mark="true">secure AWS servers</strong> with strong <strong data-renderer-mark="true">data encryption and privacy safeguards</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="2933">Supported by a <strong data-renderer-mark="true">local technical team</strong> for quick assistance.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="2994">This means you get a <strong data-renderer-mark="true">reliable, affordable, and culturally relevant EMR platform</strong> with zero compromise on security.</p>
</div></li><li class="accordion__item "><div class="accordion__header " 
                id="accordion-header-post-183"
                role="button"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="accordion-content-post-183"
                data-id="post-183" 
                data-item="hfaq-post-183" 
                style="background:transparent;" 
                data-tags=""
                tabindex="0"><div class="accordion__title">Can I access DocPP from anywhere?</div></div><div id="accordion-content-post-183" 
                class="accordion__body" 
                role="region"
                aria-labelledby="accordion-header-post-183"
                style="background:transparent;"><p data-renderer-start-pos="3145">Absolutely. DocPP is a <strong data-renderer-mark="true">cloud-based EMR system</strong>, meaning you can securely log in from:</p>
<ul class="ak-ul" data-indent-level="1">
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="3233">Your clinic computer.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="3258">A laptop at home.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="3279">A mobile device while travelling.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="3316">All you need is an <strong data-renderer-mark="true">internet connection</strong>. This makes it easy for <strong data-renderer-mark="true">doctors, nurses, and administrators</strong> to work collaboratively in real-time.</p>
</div></li><li class="accordion__item "><div class="accordion__header " 
                id="accordion-header-post-184"
                role="button"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="accordion-content-post-184"
                data-id="post-184" 
                data-item="hfaq-post-184" 
                style="background:transparent;" 
                data-tags=""
                tabindex="0"><div class="accordion__title">Does DocPP support multiple doctors and staff accounts?</div></div><div id="accordion-content-post-184" 
                class="accordion__body" 
                role="region"
                aria-labelledby="accordion-header-post-184"
                style="background:transparent;"><p data-renderer-start-pos="3512">Yes. DocPP is built for <strong data-renderer-mark="true">private practices, clinics, and hospitals</strong>. You can create:</p>
<ul class="ak-ul" data-indent-level="1">
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="3598">Separate logins for <strong data-renderer-mark="true">doctors, receptionists, and administrators</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="3665">Role-specific access levels (e.g., only doctors can view patient prescriptions).</p>
</li>
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="3749">Shared dashboards to track <strong data-renderer-mark="true">appointments, billing, and patient history</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="3823">This makes DocPP ideal for <strong data-renderer-mark="true">solo practitioners and multi-doctor clinics</strong>.</p>
</div></li><li class="accordion__item "><div class="accordion__header " 
                id="accordion-header-post-185"
                role="button"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="accordion-content-post-185"
                data-id="post-185" 
                data-item="hfaq-post-185" 
                style="background:transparent;" 
                data-tags=""
                tabindex="0"><div class="accordion__title">How do I migrate my existing patient records into DocPP?</div></div><div id="accordion-content-post-185" 
                class="accordion__body" 
                role="region"
                aria-labelledby="accordion-header-post-185"
                style="background:transparent;"><p data-renderer-start-pos="3955">We offer a <strong data-renderer-mark="true">seamless migration process</strong>. Our team can help you:</p>
<ul class="ak-ul" data-indent-level="1">
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="4020">Import <strong data-renderer-mark="true">Excel, CSV, or legacy EMR data</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="4062">Digitise paper-based records into <strong data-renderer-mark="true">electronic medical records</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="4127">Ensure <strong data-renderer-mark="true">data accuracy and security</strong> during transfer.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="4181">You won’t lose any patient history — everything will be migrated into your new <strong data-renderer-mark="true">DocPP account</strong>.</p>
</div></li><li class="accordion__item "><div class="accordion__header " 
                id="accordion-header-post-186"
                role="button"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="accordion-content-post-186"
                data-id="post-186" 
                data-item="hfaq-post-186" 
                style="background:transparent;" 
                data-tags=""
                tabindex="0"><div class="accordion__title">How much does DocPP cost after the free trial?</div></div><div id="accordion-content-post-186" 
                class="accordion__body" 
                role="region"
                aria-labelledby="accordion-header-post-186"
                style="background:transparent;"><p>Our pricing is <strong data-renderer-mark="true">transparent and affordable</strong>, designed for <strong data-renderer-mark="true">Sri Lankan medical professionals</strong>. After your <strong data-renderer-mark="true">14-day free trial</strong>, you can subscribe monthly or annually using any <strong data-renderer-mark="true">Sri Lankan online payment method</strong>. We also offer <strong data-renderer-mark="true">discounts for multi-doctor clinics</strong> and <strong data-renderer-mark="true">long-term subscriptions</strong>.</p>
</div></li><li class="accordion__item "><div class="accordion__header " 
                id="accordion-header-post-187"
                role="button"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="accordion-content-post-187"
                data-id="post-187" 
                data-item="hfaq-post-187" 
                style="background:transparent;" 
                data-tags=""
                tabindex="0"><div class="accordion__title">Do I need IT knowledge to use DocPP?</div></div><div id="accordion-content-post-187" 
                class="accordion__body" 
                role="region"
                aria-labelledby="accordion-header-post-187"
                style="background:transparent;"><p data-renderer-start-pos="4645">Not at all. DocPP is designed with <strong data-renderer-mark="true">doctors and clinic staff in mind</strong> — no coding or IT expertise required. The interface is:</p>
<ul class="ak-ul" data-indent-level="1">
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="4772"><strong data-renderer-mark="true">Simple and user-friendly</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="4801">Customisable with your <strong data-renderer-mark="true">own drug lists, treatments.</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
</div></li><li class="accordion__item "><div class="accordion__header " 
                id="accordion-header-post-188"
                role="button"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="accordion-content-post-188"
                data-id="post-188" 
                data-item="hfaq-post-188" 
                style="background:transparent;" 
                data-tags=""
                tabindex="0"><div class="accordion__title">Does DocPP support e-prescriptions and digital billing?</div></div><div id="accordion-content-post-188" 
                class="accordion__body" 
                role="region"
                aria-labelledby="accordion-header-post-188"
                style="background:transparent;"><p data-renderer-start-pos="4913">Yes. DocPP allows you to:</p>
<ul class="ak-ul" data-indent-level="1">
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="4942">Create <strong data-renderer-mark="true">electronic prescriptions</strong> with your own customised drug list.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="5013">Generate <strong data-renderer-mark="true">patient invoices and receipts</strong> instantly.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="5066">Accept payments through <strong data-renderer-mark="true">local online gateways</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="5116">Track <strong data-renderer-mark="true">outstanding payments and revenue reports</strong> in real-time.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="5180">This makes your practice more <strong data-renderer-mark="true">efficient, professional, and paperless</strong>.</p>
</div></li><li class="accordion__item "><div class="accordion__header " 
                id="accordion-header-post-189"
                role="button"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="accordion-content-post-189"
                data-id="post-189" 
                data-item="hfaq-post-189" 
                style="background:transparent;" 
                data-tags=""
                tabindex="0"><div class="accordion__title">What happens if my internet goes down?</div></div><div id="accordion-content-post-189" 
                class="accordion__body" 
                role="region"
                aria-labelledby="accordion-header-post-189"
                style="background:transparent;"><p data-renderer-start-pos="5292">DocPP is a <strong data-renderer-mark="true">cloud-first EMR</strong>, so it needs internet access. However:</p>
<ul class="ak-ul" data-indent-level="1">
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="5361">Your data is always safe on AWS servers.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="5405">Once the internet reconnects, you can <strong data-renderer-mark="true">instantly resume work</strong> without losing any records.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="5496">We recommend <strong data-renderer-mark="true">4G backup internet</strong> or mobile hotspot for uninterrupted access.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</div></li><li class="accordion__item "><div class="accordion__header " 
                id="accordion-header-post-190"
                role="button"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="accordion-content-post-190"
                data-id="post-190" 
                data-item="hfaq-post-190" 
                style="background:transparent;" 
                data-tags=""
                tabindex="0"><div class="accordion__title">Can DocPP grow with my clinic?</div></div><div id="accordion-content-post-190" 
                class="accordion__body" 
                role="region"
                aria-labelledby="accordion-header-post-190"
                style="background:transparent;"><p data-renderer-start-pos="5608">Yes. DocPP is fully <strong data-renderer-mark="true">scalable</strong>:</p>
<ul class="ak-ul" data-indent-level="1">
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="5641">Start as a <strong data-renderer-mark="true">solo practice</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="5670">Add more doctors, branches, or services as your clinic expands.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="5737">Use <strong data-renderer-mark="true">advanced modules</strong> like reporting, inventory, and staff management as you grow.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-renderer-start-pos="5822">You’ll never outgrow the system — DocPP grows with your practice.</p>
</div></li><li class="accordion__item "><div class="accordion__header " 
                id="accordion-header-post-204"
                role="button"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="accordion-content-post-204"
                data-id="post-204" 
                data-item="hfaq-post-204" 
                style="background:transparent;" 
                data-tags=""
                tabindex="0"><div class="accordion__title">Why Clinics Stay with DocPP</div></div><div id="accordion-content-post-204" 
                class="accordion__body" 
                role="region"
                aria-labelledby="accordion-header-post-204"
                style="background:transparent;"><p>When clinics choose DocPP, they are not just adopting a product—they’re gaining a long-term partner in healthcare innovation.</p>
<ul>
<li>Reliable, future-ready technology with continuous updates</li>
<li>A team that speaks both the language of doctors and developers</li>
<li>Over a decade of proven stability and customer loyalty</li>
<li>A client-first philosophy that ensures solutions are tailored, not generic</li>
</ul>
</div></li><li class="accordion__item "><div class="accordion__header " 
                id="accordion-header-post-213"
                role="button"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="accordion-content-post-213"
                data-id="post-213" 
                data-item="hfaq-post-213" 
                style="background:transparent;" 
                data-tags=""
                tabindex="0"><div class="accordion__title">Does DocPP has Artificial Intelligent Features (AI Features)</div></div><div id="accordion-content-post-213" 
                class="accordion__body" 
                role="region"
                aria-labelledby="accordion-header-post-213"
                style="background:transparent;"><p>Yes, DocPP comes with all users having AI Patient Overview where AI will analyze patient past medical history and come up with suggestions, recommendation and management plans.</p>
</div></li><li class="accordion__item "><div class="accordion__header " 
                id="accordion-header-post-4547"
                role="button"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="accordion-content-post-4547"
                data-id="post-4547" 
                data-item="hfaq-post-4547" 
                style="background:transparent;" 
                data-tags=""
                tabindex="0"><div class="accordion__title">I have on going PP. How can I implement this system without much affect to the patients and staff?</div></div><div id="accordion-content-post-4547" 
                class="accordion__body" 
                role="region"
                aria-labelledby="accordion-header-post-4547"
                style="background:transparent;"><div class="gmail_default">
<div class="gmail_default">
<div class="gmail_default">
<div>
<div class="gmail_default">
<div class="gmail_default"><b><span style="color: #ff0000">PROPOSED IMPLEMENTATION PLAN</span></b></div>
<div class="gmail_default">Plan of Action:</div>
<div class="gmail_default">1. <b><i>Run Dispensar level:</i></b> New patient registration and make an appointment. &#8211; for two (2) weeks.</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<blockquote>
<blockquote>
<div class="gmail_default">
<div class="gmail_default">
<div class="gmail_default">
<div>
<div class="gmail_default">
<div class="gmail_default">Make sure to send SMS reminders</div>
<div class="gmail_default">Issue appointment tokens via the Thermal Printer</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</blockquote>
</blockquote>
<blockquote>
<blockquote>
<div class="gmail_default">
<div class="gmail_default">
<div class="gmail_default">
<div>
<div class="gmail_default">
<div class="gmail_default">Take the patient mobile number also to the system</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</blockquote>
</blockquote>
<blockquote>
<blockquote>
<div class="gmail_default">
<div class="gmail_default">
<div class="gmail_default">
<div>
<div class="gmail_default">
<div class="gmail_default"><span style="color: #ff9900">This approach will train your dispenser to work with the system while patients also get some benefit (SMS &amp; Printed Token) and still you (doctor) no actively use the system. Out of this, you may manage the patient traffic.</span></div>
<div class="gmail_default"></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</blockquote>
</blockquote>
<div class="gmail_default">
<div class="gmail_default">
<div class="gmail_default">
<div class="gmail_default">
<div class="gmail_default">2. Doctor (you) use system to issue Non-OPD functionalities such as issuing of Medical Certificate, Referral) &#8211; 2 weeks</div>
<div class="gmail_default">
<div class="gmail_default"><span style="color: #ff9900">This approach will train you with the system without making delays to your patients. With time you will understand and realize how the system can use for different use-cases.</span></div>
<div class="gmail_default"><span style="color: #ff9900"> </span></div>
</div>
<div class="gmail_default">3. Add Drug names (without stocks), Supplier information, and enter OPD visit information. (You may prescribe the drug as &#8220;Phar&#8221; since no stocks are available yet).- 1 weeks</div>
<div class="gmail_default">
<div class="gmail_default"><span style="color: #ff9900">This approach will also further train you with the system without making delays to your patients. </span></div>
<div class="gmail_default"><span style="color: #ff9900"> </span></div>
</div>
<div class="gmail_default">4. Add Hint options to the lists such as &#8220;Presenting Complaints, Diagnosis, Management, Ix to be prescribed&#8221;.- 1 weeks</div>
<div class="gmail_default">This approach will be ready to go live. Reduce the time will take for a patient.</div>
<div class="gmail_default"></div>
<div class="gmail_default">
<div class="gmail_default">5. Create a new test patient and make &#8220;My Favorite&#8221; drug sets which are commonly used.- 1 weeks</div>
<div class="gmail_default">This approach will be ready for fast drug prescribing</div>
</div>
<div class="gmail_default"></div>
<div class="gmail_default">
<div class="gmail_default">6. Update drug stocks and ready for the complete system drive.- 1 weeks</div>
<div class="gmail_default">This approach will be ready for fast drug prescribing</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div></li><li class="accordion__item "><div class="accordion__header " 
                id="accordion-header-post-4549"
                role="button"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="accordion-content-post-4549"
                data-id="post-4549" 
                data-item="hfaq-post-4549" 
                style="background:transparent;" 
                data-tags=""
                tabindex="0"><div class="accordion__title">I got Admin credentials to access my DocPP account. How should I start then?</div></div><div id="accordion-content-post-4549" 
                class="accordion__body" 
                role="region"
                aria-labelledby="accordion-header-post-4549"
                style="background:transparent;"><p>Congratulations. You are now member of DocPP. Here how you can start the journey&#8230;</p>
<div class="gmail_default"><b>Step 1: </b>Create user accounts for the Medical center staff</div>
<div class="gmail_default"><b>Step 2: </b>List down the drug details into a paper (DrugName, Dosage form, Qty on Hand = 0, Re-Orde Level,  UnitCost Price, Unit Selling Price)</div>
<div class="gmail_default">&#8211; Add New drug names to the system ( in this case keep &#8220;Qty on Hand&#8221;as 0 in order to update them later)</div>
<div class="gmail_default"><b>Step 3: </b>Add a list of supplier details</div>
</div></li></ul></div></div></article></section>		</div>
	 </div>
	 </section>

  </main>
<script data-cfasync="false" src="/cdn-cgi/scripts/5c5dd728/cloudflare-static/email-decode.min.js"></script><script type="b53a4d2c871bfeeaf185dd67-text/javascript">
(function () {
  const tabs = document.querySelectorAll('.billing-tab');
  const prices = document.querySelectorAll('.pricing .price');
  const units = document.querySelectorAll('.pricing .price-unit');

  function update(period) {
    // toggle active state & aria
    tabs.forEach(btn => {
      const isActive = btn.dataset.period === period;
      btn.classList.toggle('active', isActive);
      btn.setAttribute('aria-selected', String(isActive));
    });

    // update numbers & unit label
    prices.forEach(el => {
      const val = el.dataset[period]; // data-monthly or data-weekly
      if (typeof val !== 'undefined') el.textContent = val;
    });
    units.forEach(u => u.textContent = period === 'weekly' ? '/yearly' : '/mo');
  }

  // attach listeners
  tabs.forEach(btn => btn.addEventListener('click', () => update(btn.dataset.period)));

  // init default state
  update('monthly'); // change to 'weekly' if you want weekly by default
})();
</script>
