<script type="application/ld+json" class="helpie-faq-schema">{
                    "@context": "https://schema.org",
                    "@type": "FAQPage",
                    "mainEntity": [{"@type":"Question","url":"https:\/\/healthcare.lk\/#hfaq-post-151","name":"There are free EMR systems. But you don\u2019t offer a free one. Why?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It\u2019s true that some providers claim to offer free EMR (Electronic Medical Records) systems. However, most of these solutions are either unsafe, unstable, or unsustainable. Many so-called free EMR platforms:\r\n\r\n\r\n \t\r\nCollect and analyse your patient data without proper security.\r\n\r\n \t\r\nLack strong privacy protection or compliance with healthcare data standards.\r\n\r\n \t\r\nShut down after a few months, causing you to lose all patient records and clinical history.\r\n\r\n\r\nRunning a reliable EMR software solution requires continuous development, hosting, and security maintenance. If a provider isn\u2019t charging, they are often earning ROI from your data or cutting corners. At DocPP, we prioritise data security, system reliability, and long-term sustainability\u2014that\u2019s why we don\u2019t offer a \u201cfree forever\u201d plan."}},{"@type":"Question","url":"https:\/\/healthcare.lk\/#hfaq-post-152","name":"Do you offer a free trial period?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. We provide a 14-day free trial of the complete DocPP system. During this time, you can:\r\n\r\n\r\n \t\r\nRun your private practice without limitations.\r\n\r\n \t\r\nAdd your own drugs, treatment records, and clinical data.\r\n\r\n \t\r\nExperience the full features of our EMR platform risk-free."}},{"@type":"Question","url":"https:\/\/healthcare.lk\/#hfaq-post-153","name":"How can I renew the system?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Renewal is fully automated. You can use any Sri Lankan online payment method (Visa, MasterCard, internet banking, mobile wallets, etc.). Once payment is completed, your DocPP subscription is instantly updated with no downtime."}},{"@type":"Question","url":"https:\/\/healthcare.lk\/#hfaq-post-179","name":"What is your technical stack?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Our healthcare software has been in the industry for over 12 years, trusted by hundreds of medical professionals. In 2022, we completely revamped the platform using the latest PHP 8.x framework, ensuring:\r\n\r\n\r\n \t\r\nHigh-level security updates.\r\n\r\n \t\r\nGreater system scalability and performance.\r\n\r\n \t\r\nLong-term adaptability for new healthcare technology needs."}},{"@type":"Question","url":"https:\/\/healthcare.lk\/#hfaq-post-180","name":"Where is my data hosted?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Your data is protected with enterprise-grade AWS security. We use dedicated, non-shared servers to keep your patient records, prescriptions, and medical histories safe, private, and compliant with healthcare security standards."}},{"@type":"Question","url":"https:\/\/healthcare.lk\/#hfaq-post-181","name":"Can I lose my data? What about data recovery?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. DocPP has a comprehensive disaster recovery system in place. We perform regular encrypted backups and maintain redundant storage mechanisms to ensure that your patient data is never lost\u2014even in the event of system failure."}},{"@type":"Question","url":"https:\/\/healthcare.lk\/#hfaq-post-182","name":"Why should I choose DocPP over other EMR systems?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"DocPP is a Sri Lankan-built EMR solution designed specifically for local healthcare practices. Unlike generic international software, DocPP is:\r\n\r\n\r\n \t\r\nTailored for Sri Lankan doctors and clinics (support for local drug databases, workflows, and payment methods).\r\n\r\n \t\r\nBacked since 2008 (nearly 2 decades\u00a0of real-world use and continuous upgrades.\r\n\r\n \t\r\nHosted on secure AWS servers with strong data encryption and privacy safeguards.\r\n\r\n \t\r\nSupported by a local technical team for quick assistance.\r\n\r\n\r\nThis means you get a reliable, affordable, and culturally relevant EMR platform with zero compromise on security."}},{"@type":"Question","url":"https:\/\/healthcare.lk\/#hfaq-post-183","name":"Can I access DocPP from anywhere?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Absolutely. DocPP is a cloud-based EMR system, meaning you can securely log in from:\r\n\r\n\r\n \t\r\nYour clinic computer.\r\n\r\n \t\r\nA laptop at home.\r\n\r\n \t\r\nA mobile device while travelling.\r\n\r\n\r\nAll you need is an internet connection. This makes it easy for doctors, nurses, and administrators to work collaboratively in real-time."}},{"@type":"Question","url":"https:\/\/healthcare.lk\/#hfaq-post-184","name":"Does DocPP support multiple doctors and staff accounts?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. DocPP is built for private practices, clinics, and hospitals. You can create:\r\n\r\n\r\n \t\r\nSeparate logins for doctors, receptionists, and administrators.\r\n\r\n \t\r\nRole-specific access levels (e.g., only doctors can view patient prescriptions).\r\n\r\n \t\r\nShared dashboards to track appointments, billing, and patient history.\r\n\r\n\r\nThis makes DocPP ideal for solo practitioners and multi-doctor clinics."}},{"@type":"Question","url":"https:\/\/healthcare.lk\/#hfaq-post-185","name":"How do I migrate my existing patient records into DocPP?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We offer a seamless migration process. Our team can help you:\r\n\r\n\r\n \t\r\nImport Excel, CSV, or legacy EMR data.\r\n\r\n \t\r\nDigitise paper-based records into electronic medical records.\r\n\r\n \t\r\nEnsure data accuracy and security during transfer.\r\n\r\n\r\nYou won\u2019t lose any patient history \u2014 everything will be migrated into your new DocPP account."}},{"@type":"Question","url":"https:\/\/healthcare.lk\/#hfaq-post-186","name":"How much does DocPP cost after the free trial?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Our pricing is transparent and affordable, designed for Sri Lankan medical professionals. After your 14-day free trial, you can subscribe monthly or annually using any Sri Lankan online payment method. We also offer discounts for multi-doctor clinics and long-term subscriptions."}},{"@type":"Question","url":"https:\/\/healthcare.lk\/#hfaq-post-187","name":"Do I need IT knowledge to use DocPP?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Not at all. DocPP is designed with doctors and clinic staff in mind \u2014 no coding or IT expertise required. The interface is:\r\n\r\n\r\n \t\r\nSimple and user-friendly.\r\n\r\n \t\r\nCustomisable with your own drug lists, treatments."}},{"@type":"Question","url":"https:\/\/healthcare.lk\/#hfaq-post-188","name":"Does DocPP support e-prescriptions and digital billing?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. DocPP allows you to:\r\n\r\n\r\n \t\r\nCreate electronic prescriptions with your own customised drug list.\r\n\r\n \t\r\nGenerate patient invoices and receipts instantly.\r\n\r\n \t\r\nAccept payments through local online gateways.\r\n\r\n \t\r\nTrack outstanding payments and revenue reports in real-time.\r\n\r\n\r\nThis makes your practice more efficient, professional, and paperless."}},{"@type":"Question","url":"https:\/\/healthcare.lk\/#hfaq-post-189","name":"What happens if my internet goes down?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"DocPP is a cloud-first EMR, so it needs internet access. However:\r\n\r\n\r\n \t\r\nYour data is always safe on AWS servers.\r\n\r\n \t\r\nOnce the internet reconnects, you can instantly resume work without losing any records.\r\n\r\n \t\r\nWe recommend 4G backup internet or mobile hotspot for uninterrupted access."}},{"@type":"Question","url":"https:\/\/healthcare.lk\/#hfaq-post-190","name":"Can DocPP grow with my clinic?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. DocPP is fully scalable:\r\n\r\n\r\n \t\r\nStart as a solo practice.\r\n\r\n \t\r\nAdd more doctors, branches, or services as your clinic expands.\r\n\r\n \t\r\nUse advanced modules like reporting, inventory, and staff management as you grow.\r\n\r\n\r\nYou\u2019ll never outgrow the system \u2014 DocPP grows with your practice."}},{"@type":"Question","url":"https:\/\/healthcare.lk\/#hfaq-post-204","name":"Why Clinics Stay with DocPP","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"When clinics choose DocPP, they are not just adopting a product\u2014they\u2019re gaining a long-term partner in healthcare innovation.\r\n\r\n \tReliable, future-ready technology with continuous updates\r\n \tA team that speaks both the language of doctors and developers\r\n \tOver a decade of proven stability and customer loyalty\r\n \tA client-first philosophy that ensures solutions are tailored, not generic"}},{"@type":"Question","url":"https:\/\/healthcare.lk\/#hfaq-post-213","name":"Does DocPP has Artificial Intelligent Features (AI Features)","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, DocPP comes with all users having AI Patient Overview where AI will analyze patient past medical history and come up with suggestions, recommendation and management plans."}},{"@type":"Question","url":"https:\/\/healthcare.lk\/#hfaq-post-4547","name":"I have on going PP. How can I implement this system without much affect to the patients and staff?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"PROPOSED IMPLEMENTATION PLAN\r\nPlan of Action:\r\n1.\u00a0Run Dispensar level:\u00a0New patient registration and make an\u00a0appointment. -\u00a0for two (2) weeks.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nMake sure to send SMS reminders\r\nIssue appointment tokens via the Thermal Printer\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTake the patient mobile number also to the system\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis approach will train your dispenser to work with the system while patients also get some benefit (SMS &amp; Printed Token) and still you (doctor) no actively use the system. Out of\u00a0this, you may manage the patient traffic.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n2. Doctor (you) use system to issue Non-OPD functionalities such as issuing of Medical Certificate, Referral) -\u00a02 weeks\r\n\r\nThis approach will train you with the system without making delays to your patients. With time you will understand\u00a0and realize how the\u00a0system can use for different use-cases.\r\n\u00a0\r\n\r\n3. Add Drug names (without stocks), Supplier information, and enter OPD visit information. (You may prescribe the drug as \"Phar\" since no stocks are available yet).-\u00a01 weeks\r\n\r\nThis approach will also further train you with the system without making delays to your patients.\u00a0\r\n\u00a0\r\n\r\n4. Add Hint options to the lists such as \"Presenting Complaints, Diagnosis, Management, Ix to be prescribed\".-\u00a01 weeks\r\nThis approach will be ready to go live. Reduce the time will take for a patient.\r\n\r\n\r\n5. Create a new test patient\u00a0and make \"My Favorite\" drug sets which are commonly used.-\u00a01 weeks\r\nThis approach will be ready\u00a0for fast drug prescribing\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n6. Update drug stocks and ready for the complete system drive.-\u00a01 weeks\r\nThis approach will be ready\u00a0for fast drug prescribing"}},{"@type":"Question","url":"https:\/\/healthcare.lk\/#hfaq-post-4549","name":"I got Admin credentials to access my DocPP account. How should I start then?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Congratulations. You are now member of DocPP. Here how you can start the journey...\r\nStep 1: Create user accounts for the Medical center staff\r\nStep 2: List down the drug details into a paper (DrugName, Dosage form, Qty on Hand = 0, Re-Orde Level,\u00a0 UnitCost Price, Unit Selling Price)\r\n- Add New drug names to the system ( in this case keep \"Qty on Hand\"as 0 in order to update them later)\r\nStep 3: Add a list of supplier details"}}]
                }</script><script type="b53a4d2c871bfeeaf185dd67-text/javascript">window.HELPIE_FAQS = [{"collection":{"display_mode":"simple_accordion","open_by_default":"open_first","faq_url_attribute":"1","limit":"-1","faq_url_type":"post_id","enable_faq_styles":false,"accordion_background":{"header":"transparent","body":"transparent"}},"items":[{"slug":"there-are-free-emr-systems-but-you-dont-offer-a-free-one-why","title":"There are free EMR systems. But you don\u2019t offer a free one. Why?","content":"<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"199\">It\u2019s true that some providers claim to offer <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">free EMR (Electronic Medical Records) systems<\/strong>. However, most of these solutions are either unsafe, unstable, or unsustainable. Many so-called free EMR platforms:<\/p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"ak-ul\" data-indent-level=\"1\">\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"409\">Collect and analyse your <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">patient data<\/strong> without proper security.<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"475\">Lack strong <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">privacy protection<\/strong> or compliance with healthcare data standards.<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"555\">Shut down after a few months, causing you to lose all <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">patient records and clinical history<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"650\">Running a reliable <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">EMR software solution<\/strong> requires continuous development, hosting, and security maintenance. If a provider isn\u2019t charging, they are often earning ROI from your data or cutting corners. At DocPP, we prioritise <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">data security, system reliability, and long-term sustainability<\/strong>\u2014that\u2019s why we don\u2019t offer a \u201cfree forever\u201d plan.<\/p>","post_id":151,"count":[{"09-09-2025":9,"2025-09":13,"all-time":18,"15-09-2025":4,"09-12-2025":3,"2025-12":3,"24-07-2026":1,"2026-07":2,"30-07-2026":1}],"excerpt":"","post_date":"2025-09-09 14:02:39","post_modified":"2026-07-24 04:12:59"},{"slug":"do-you-offer-a-free-trial-period","title":"Do you offer a free trial period?","content":"<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"1025\">Yes. We provide a <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">14-day free trial<\/strong> of the complete DocPP system. During this time, you can:<\/p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"ak-ul\" data-indent-level=\"1\">\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"1121\">Run your <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">private practice<\/strong> without limitations.<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"1171\">Add your own <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">drugs, treatment records, and clinical data<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"1232\">Experience the <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">full features of our EMR platform<\/strong> risk-free.<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>","post_id":152,"count":[{"09-09-2025":3,"2025-09":7,"all-time":37,"15-09-2025":2,"18-09-2025":1,"23-09-2025":1,"01-10-2025":2,"2025-10":5,"10-10-2025":1,"22-10-2025":1,"27-10-2025":1,"07-11-2025":1,"2025-11":4,"11-11-2025":1,"12-11-2025":1,"23-11-2025":1,"07-12-2025":1,"2025-12":14,"09-12-2025":6,"11-12-2025":1,"14-12-2025":1,"15-12-2025":2,"20-12-2025":1,"25-12-2025":1,"29-12-2025":1,"05-01-2026":1,"2026-01":1,"18-02-2026":2,"2026-02":2,"02-03-2026":1,"2026-03":2,"04-03-2026":1,"04-04-2026":1,"2026-04":1,"22-05-2026":1,"2026-05":1}],"excerpt":"","post_date":"2025-09-09 14:02:39","post_modified":"2026-07-24 04:12:59"},{"slug":"how-can-i-renew-the-system","title":"How can I renew the system?","content":"Renewal is fully <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">automated<\/strong>. You can use any <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">Sri Lankan online payment method<\/strong> (Visa, MasterCard, internet banking, mobile wallets, etc.). Once payment is completed, your <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">DocPP subscription<\/strong> is instantly updated with no downtime.","post_id":153,"count":[{"09-09-2025":2,"2025-09":5,"all-time":36,"15-09-2025":2,"23-09-2025":1,"01-10-2025":1,"2025-10":6,"02-10-2025":1,"10-10-2025":1,"13-10-2025":1,"22-10-2025":1,"27-10-2025":1,"11-11-2025":1,"2025-11":3,"12-11-2025":1,"23-11-2025":1,"05-12-2025":1,"2025-12":13,"07-12-2025":1,"09-12-2025":6,"10-12-2025":1,"11-12-2025":1,"14-12-2025":2,"15-12-2025":1,"05-01-2026":1,"2026-01":2,"12-01-2026":1,"18-02-2026":1,"2026-02":1,"02-03-2026":1,"2026-03":2,"04-03-2026":1,"14-04-2026":1,"2026-04":1,"19-05-2026":1,"2026-05":3,"22-05-2026":1,"23-05-2026":1}],"excerpt":"","post_date":"2025-09-09 14:02:39","post_modified":"2026-07-24 04:13:00"},{"slug":"what-is-your-technical-stack","title":"What is your technical stack?","content":"<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"1585\">Our <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">healthcare software<\/strong> has been in the industry for over <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">12 years<\/strong>, trusted by hundreds of medical professionals. In 2022, we completely revamped the platform using the <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">latest PHP 8.x framework<\/strong>, ensuring:<\/p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"ak-ul\" data-indent-level=\"1\">\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"1793\">High-level <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">security updates<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"1825\">Greater <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">system scalability and performance<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"1872\">Long-term adaptability for new healthcare technology needs.<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>","post_id":179,"count":[{"15-09-2025":2,"2025-09":4,"all-time":32,"16-09-2025":1,"23-09-2025":1,"01-10-2025":1,"2025-10":5,"10-10-2025":1,"13-10-2025":1,"22-10-2025":1,"27-10-2025":1,"11-11-2025":1,"2025-11":3,"12-11-2025":1,"23-11-2025":1,"07-12-2025":1,"2025-12":10,"09-12-2025":6,"11-12-2025":1,"14-12-2025":1,"15-12-2025":1,"05-01-2026":1,"2026-01":3,"12-01-2026":1,"23-01-2026":1,"04-03-2026":1,"2026-03":1,"04-04-2026":2,"2026-04":2,"22-05-2026":1,"2026-05":2,"23-05-2026":1,"10-07-2026":1,"2026-07":1,"19-08-2026":1,"2026-08":1}],"excerpt":"","post_date":"2025-09-09 16:30:31","post_modified":"2026-07-24 04:13:01"},{"slug":"where-is-my-data-hosted","title":"Where is my data hosted?","content":"Your data is protected with <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">enterprise-grade AWS security<\/strong>. We use <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">dedicated, non-shared servers<\/strong> to keep your <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">patient records, prescriptions, and medical histories<\/strong> safe, private, and compliant with healthcare security standards.","post_id":180,"count":[{"15-09-2025":2,"2025-09":3,"all-time":31,"23-09-2025":1,"01-10-2025":1,"2025-10":5,"09-10-2025":1,"10-10-2025":1,"27-10-2025":1,"28-10-2025":1,"11-11-2025":1,"2025-11":3,"12-11-2025":1,"23-11-2025":1,"07-12-2025":1,"2025-12":10,"09-12-2025":6,"11-12-2025":1,"14-12-2025":1,"15-12-2025":1,"05-01-2026":1,"2026-01":3,"12-01-2026":1,"23-01-2026":1,"18-02-2026":1,"2026-02":2,"27-02-2026":1,"22-05-2026":1,"2026-05":2,"23-05-2026":1,"09-06-2026":1,"2026-06":1,"10-07-2026":1,"2026-07":1,"19-08-2026":1,"2026-08":1}],"excerpt":"","post_date":"2025-09-09 16:30:31","post_modified":"2026-07-24 04:13:02"},{"slug":"can-i-lose-my-data-what-about-data-recovery","title":"Can I lose my data? What about data recovery?","content":"No. DocPP has a <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">comprehensive disaster recovery system<\/strong> in place. We perform <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">regular encrypted backups<\/strong> and maintain <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">redundant storage mechanisms<\/strong> to ensure that your <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">patient data is never lost<\/strong>\u2014even in the event of system failure.","post_id":181,"count":[{"15-09-2025":1,"2025-09":2,"all-time":26,"23-09-2025":1,"01-10-2025":1,"2025-10":3,"10-10-2025":1,"27-10-2025":1,"11-11-2025":1,"2025-11":2,"23-11-2025":1,"07-12-2025":1,"2025-12":10,"09-12-2025":6,"11-12-2025":1,"14-12-2025":1,"15-12-2025":1,"05-01-2026":1,"2026-01":2,"12-01-2026":1,"18-02-2026":1,"2026-02":2,"27-02-2026":1,"04-04-2026":1,"2026-04":1,"22-05-2026":1,"2026-05":2,"23-05-2026":1,"09-06-2026":1,"2026-06":1,"10-07-2026":1,"2026-07":1}],"excerpt":"","post_date":"2025-09-09 16:30:31","post_modified":"2026-07-24 04:13:03"},{"slug":"why-should-i-choose-docpp-over-other-emr-systems","title":"Why should I choose DocPP over other EMR systems?","content":"<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"2521\">DocPP is a <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">Sri Lankan-built EMR solution<\/strong> designed specifically for <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">local healthcare practices<\/strong>. Unlike generic international software, DocPP is:<\/p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"ak-ul\" data-indent-level=\"1\">\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"2668\"><strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">Tailored for Sri Lankan doctors and clinics<\/strong> (support for local drug databases, workflows, and payment methods).<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"2783\">Backed since <strong>2008 (nearly 2 decades\u00a0of real-world use<\/strong> and continuous upgrades.<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"2849\">Hosted on <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">secure AWS servers<\/strong> with strong <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">data encryption and privacy safeguards<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"2933\">Supported by a <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">local technical team<\/strong> for quick assistance.<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"2994\">This means you get a <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">reliable, affordable, and culturally relevant EMR platform<\/strong> with zero compromise on security.<\/p>","post_id":182,"count":[{"15-09-2025":1,"2025-09":2,"all-time":28,"23-09-2025":1,"01-10-2025":1,"2025-10":4,"16-10-2025":1,"20-10-2025":1,"27-10-2025":1,"11-11-2025":1,"2025-11":1,"07-12-2025":1,"2025-12":10,"09-12-2025":6,"11-12-2025":1,"14-12-2025":1,"15-12-2025":1,"05-01-2026":1,"2026-01":2,"12-01-2026":1,"09-02-2026":1,"2026-02":3,"18-02-2026":1,"27-02-2026":1,"14-04-2026":1,"2026-04":1,"19-05-2026":1,"2026-05":3,"22-05-2026":1,"23-05-2026":1,"10-07-2026":1,"2026-07":2,"24-07-2026":1}],"excerpt":"","post_date":"2025-09-09 16:30:31","post_modified":"2026-07-24 04:13:04"},{"slug":"can-i-access-docpp-from-anywhere","title":"Can I access DocPP from anywhere?","content":"<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"3145\">Absolutely. DocPP is a <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">cloud-based EMR system<\/strong>, meaning you can securely log in from:<\/p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"ak-ul\" data-indent-level=\"1\">\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"3233\">Your clinic computer.<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"3258\">A laptop at home.<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"3279\">A mobile device while travelling.<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"3316\">All you need is an <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">internet connection<\/strong>. This makes it easy for <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">doctors, nurses, and administrators<\/strong> to work collaboratively in real-time.<\/p>","post_id":183,"count":[{"15-09-2025":1,"2025-09":2,"all-time":22,"23-09-2025":1,"01-10-2025":1,"2025-10":2,"20-10-2025":1,"11-11-2025":1,"2025-11":1,"07-12-2025":1,"2025-12":9,"09-12-2025":5,"11-12-2025":1,"14-12-2025":1,"15-12-2025":1,"05-01-2026":1,"2026-01":1,"18-02-2026":1,"2026-02":1,"04-04-2026":1,"2026-04":2,"14-04-2026":1,"22-05-2026":1,"2026-05":2,"23-05-2026":1,"10-07-2026":1,"2026-07":2,"23-07-2026":1}],"excerpt":"","post_date":"2025-09-09 16:30:31","post_modified":"2026-07-24 04:13:05"},{"slug":"does-docpp-support-multiple-doctors-and-staff-accounts","title":"Does DocPP support multiple doctors and staff accounts?","content":"<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"3512\">Yes. DocPP is built for <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">private practices, clinics, and hospitals<\/strong>. You can create:<\/p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"ak-ul\" data-indent-level=\"1\">\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"3598\">Separate logins for <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">doctors, receptionists, and administrators<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"3665\">Role-specific access levels (e.g., only doctors can view patient prescriptions).<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"3749\">Shared dashboards to track <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">appointments, billing, and patient history<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"3823\">This makes DocPP ideal for <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">solo practitioners and multi-doctor clinics<\/strong>.<\/p>","post_id":184,"count":[{"15-09-2025":1,"2025-09":2,"all-time":21,"23-09-2025":1,"01-10-2025":1,"2025-10":2,"20-10-2025":1,"11-11-2025":1,"2025-11":1,"07-12-2025":1,"2025-12":10,"09-12-2025":5,"10-12-2025":1,"11-12-2025":1,"14-12-2025":1,"15-12-2025":1,"05-01-2026":1,"2026-01":1,"04-04-2026":1,"2026-04":2,"14-04-2026":1,"23-05-2026":1,"2026-05":1,"10-07-2026":1,"2026-07":2,"24-07-2026":1}],"excerpt":"","post_date":"2025-09-09 16:30:31","post_modified":"2026-07-24 04:13:05"},{"slug":"how-do-i-migrate-my-existing-patient-records-into-docpp","title":"How do I migrate my existing patient records into DocPP?","content":"<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"3955\">We offer a <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">seamless migration process<\/strong>. Our team can help you:<\/p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"ak-ul\" data-indent-level=\"1\">\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"4020\">Import <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">Excel, CSV, or legacy EMR data<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"4062\">Digitise paper-based records into <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">electronic medical records<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"4127\">Ensure <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">data accuracy and security<\/strong> during transfer.<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"4181\">You won\u2019t lose any patient history \u2014 everything will be migrated into your new <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">DocPP account<\/strong>.<\/p>","post_id":185,"count":[{"15-09-2025":1,"2025-09":2,"all-time":18,"23-09-2025":1,"20-10-2025":1,"2025-10":1,"11-11-2025":1,"2025-11":1,"05-12-2025":1,"2025-12":9,"07-12-2025":1,"09-12-2025":5,"11-12-2025":1,"14-12-2025":1,"05-01-2026":1,"2026-01":1,"14-04-2026":1,"2026-04":1,"23-05-2026":1,"2026-05":2,"25-05-2026":1,"24-07-2026":1,"2026-07":1}],"excerpt":"","post_date":"2025-09-09 16:30:31","post_modified":"2026-07-24 04:13:06"},{"slug":"how-much-does-docpp-cost-after-the-free-trial","title":"How much does DocPP cost after the free trial?","content":"Our pricing is <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">transparent and affordable<\/strong>, designed for <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">Sri Lankan medical professionals<\/strong>. After your <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">14-day free trial<\/strong>, you can subscribe monthly or annually using any <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">Sri Lankan online payment method<\/strong>. We also offer <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">discounts for multi-doctor clinics<\/strong> and <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">long-term subscriptions<\/strong>.","post_id":186,"count":[{"15-09-2025":1,"2025-09":2,"all-time":19,"23-09-2025":1,"20-10-2025":1,"2025-10":1,"11-11-2025":1,"2025-11":1,"07-12-2025":1,"2025-12":9,"08-12-2025":1,"09-12-2025":5,"11-12-2025":1,"14-12-2025":1,"05-01-2026":1,"2026-01":1,"27-02-2026":1,"2026-02":1,"04-04-2026":1,"2026-04":1,"23-05-2026":1,"2026-05":2,"25-05-2026":1,"24-07-2026":1,"2026-07":1}],"excerpt":"","post_date":"2025-09-09 16:30:31","post_modified":"2026-07-24 04:13:07"},{"slug":"do-i-need-it-knowledge-to-use-docpp","title":"Do I need IT knowledge to use DocPP?","content":"<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"4645\">Not at all. DocPP is designed with <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">doctors and clinic staff in mind<\/strong> \u2014 no coding or IT expertise required. The interface is:<\/p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"ak-ul\" data-indent-level=\"1\">\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"4772\"><strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">Simple and user-friendly<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"4801\">Customisable with your <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">own drug lists, treatments.<\/strong><\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>","post_id":187,"count":[{"15-09-2025":1,"2025-09":2,"all-time":22,"23-09-2025":1,"01-10-2025":1,"2025-10":4,"20-10-2025":1,"22-10-2025":1,"27-10-2025":1,"11-11-2025":1,"2025-11":1,"07-12-2025":1,"2025-12":9,"09-12-2025":6,"11-12-2025":1,"14-12-2025":1,"05-01-2026":1,"2026-01":2,"12-01-2026":1,"04-04-2026":1,"2026-04":1,"23-05-2026":1,"2026-05":1,"10-07-2026":1,"2026-07":2,"24-07-2026":1}],"excerpt":"","post_date":"2025-09-09 16:30:31","post_modified":"2026-07-24 04:13:08"},{"slug":"does-docpp-support-e-prescriptions-and-digital-billing","title":"Does DocPP support e-prescriptions and digital billing?","content":"<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"4913\">Yes. DocPP allows you to:<\/p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"ak-ul\" data-indent-level=\"1\">\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"4942\">Create <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">electronic prescriptions<\/strong> with your own customised drug list.<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"5013\">Generate <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">patient invoices and receipts<\/strong> instantly.<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"5066\">Accept payments through <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">local online gateways<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"5116\">Track <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">outstanding payments and revenue reports<\/strong> in real-time.<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"5180\">This makes your practice more <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">efficient, professional, and paperless<\/strong>.<\/p>","post_id":188,"count":[{"15-09-2025":2,"2025-09":4,"all-time":24,"16-09-2025":1,"23-09-2025":1,"01-10-2025":1,"2025-10":4,"20-10-2025":1,"22-10-2025":1,"27-10-2025":1,"11-11-2025":1,"2025-11":1,"07-12-2025":1,"2025-12":9,"09-12-2025":6,"11-12-2025":1,"14-12-2025":1,"05-01-2026":1,"2026-01":1,"04-04-2026":1,"2026-04":4,"14-04-2026":3,"23-05-2026":1,"2026-05":1}],"excerpt":"","post_date":"2025-09-09 16:30:31","post_modified":"2026-07-24 04:13:08"},{"slug":"what-happens-if-my-internet-goes-down","title":"What happens if my internet goes down?","content":"<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"5292\">DocPP is a <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">cloud-first EMR<\/strong>, so it needs internet access. However:<\/p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"ak-ul\" data-indent-level=\"1\">\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"5361\">Your data is always safe on AWS servers.<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"5405\">Once the internet reconnects, you can <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">instantly resume work<\/strong> without losing any records.<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"5496\">We recommend <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">4G backup internet<\/strong> or mobile hotspot for uninterrupted access.<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>","post_id":189,"count":[{"15-09-2025":1,"2025-09":2,"all-time":22,"23-09-2025":1,"01-10-2025":1,"2025-10":3,"20-10-2025":1,"27-10-2025":1,"11-11-2025":1,"2025-11":1,"07-12-2025":1,"2025-12":9,"08-12-2025":1,"09-12-2025":5,"11-12-2025":1,"14-12-2025":1,"05-01-2026":1,"2026-01":2,"12-01-2026":1,"27-02-2026":1,"2026-02":1,"04-04-2026":1,"2026-04":3,"14-04-2026":2,"23-05-2026":1,"2026-05":1}],"excerpt":"","post_date":"2025-09-09 16:30:31","post_modified":"2026-07-24 04:13:09"},{"slug":"can-docpp-grow-with-my-clinic","title":"Can DocPP grow with my clinic?","content":"<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"5608\">Yes. DocPP is fully <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">scalable<\/strong>:<\/p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"ak-ul\" data-indent-level=\"1\">\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"5641\">Start as a <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">solo practice<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"5670\">Add more doctors, branches, or services as your clinic expands.<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n \t<li>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"5737\">Use <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">advanced modules<\/strong> like reporting, inventory, and staff management as you grow.<\/p>\r\n<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"5822\">You\u2019ll never outgrow the system \u2014 DocPP grows with your practice.<\/p>","post_id":190,"count":[{"15-09-2025":1,"2025-09":2,"all-time":25,"23-09-2025":1,"01-10-2025":1,"2025-10":3,"20-10-2025":1,"27-10-2025":1,"11-11-2025":1,"2025-11":1,"07-12-2025":1,"2025-12":9,"09-12-2025":5,"11-12-2025":1,"14-12-2025":1,"29-12-2025":1,"05-01-2026":2,"2026-01":2,"04-02-2026":1,"2026-02":2,"27-02-2026":1,"04-04-2026":1,"2026-04":3,"14-04-2026":2,"23-05-2026":1,"2026-05":1,"10-07-2026":1,"2026-07":2,"24-07-2026":1}],"excerpt":"","post_date":"2025-09-09 16:30:31","post_modified":"2026-07-24 04:13:10"},{"slug":"why-clinics-stay-with-docpp","title":"Why Clinics Stay with DocPP","content":"When clinics choose DocPP, they are not just adopting a product\u2014they\u2019re gaining a long-term partner in healthcare innovation.\r\n<ul>\r\n \t<li>Reliable, future-ready technology with continuous updates<\/li>\r\n \t<li>A team that speaks both the language of doctors and developers<\/li>\r\n \t<li>Over a decade of proven stability and customer loyalty<\/li>\r\n \t<li>A client-first philosophy that ensures solutions are tailored, not generic<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>","post_id":204,"count":[{"17-09-2025":2,"2025-09":3,"all-time":23,"27-09-2025":1,"01-10-2025":1,"2025-10":3,"20-10-2025":1,"27-10-2025":1,"11-11-2025":1,"2025-11":1,"07-12-2025":1,"2025-12":7,"09-12-2025":5,"14-12-2025":1,"05-01-2026":1,"2026-01":2,"12-01-2026":1,"04-02-2026":1,"2026-02":2,"18-02-2026":1,"04-03-2026":1,"2026-03":1,"04-04-2026":1,"2026-04":2,"14-04-2026":1,"23-05-2026":1,"2026-05":1,"24-07-2026":1,"2026-07":1}],"excerpt":"","post_date":"2025-09-17 20:41:51","post_modified":"2026-07-24 04:13:11"},{"slug":"does-docpp-has-artificial-intelligent-features-ai-features","title":"Does DocPP has Artificial Intelligent Features (AI Features)","content":"Yes, DocPP comes with all users having AI Patient Overview where AI will analyze patient past medical history and come up with suggestions, recommendation and management plans.","post_id":213,"count":[{"18-09-2025":1,"2025-09":3,"all-time":25,"27-09-2025":2,"01-10-2025":1,"2025-10":4,"20-10-2025":1,"22-10-2025":1,"28-10-2025":1,"11-11-2025":1,"2025-11":1,"07-12-2025":1,"2025-12":10,"09-12-2025":5,"11-12-2025":1,"13-12-2025":2,"14-12-2025":1,"05-01-2026":1,"2026-01":2,"23-01-2026":1,"18-02-2026":1,"2026-02":1,"29-03-2026":1,"2026-03":1,"14-04-2026":1,"2026-04":1,"23-05-2026":1,"2026-05":1,"10-07-2026":1,"2026-07":1}],"excerpt":"","post_date":"2025-09-18 23:19:13","post_modified":"2026-07-24 04:13:12"},{"slug":"i-have-on-going-pp-how-can-i-implement-this-system-without-much-affect-to-the-patients-and-staff","title":"I have on going PP. How can I implement this system without much affect to the patients and staff?","content":"<div class=\"gmail_default\">\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\"><b><span style=\"color: #ff0000\">PROPOSED IMPLEMENTATION PLAN<\/span><\/b><\/div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">Plan of Action:<\/div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">1.\u00a0<b><i>Run Dispensar level:<\/i><\/b>\u00a0New patient registration and make an\u00a0appointment. -\u00a0for two (2) weeks.<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">Make sure to send SMS reminders<\/div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">Issue appointment tokens via the Thermal Printer<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div><\/blockquote>\r\n<\/blockquote>\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">Take the patient mobile number also to the system<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div><\/blockquote>\r\n<\/blockquote>\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\"><span style=\"color: #ff9900\">This approach will train your dispenser to work with the system while patients also get some benefit (SMS &amp; Printed Token) and still you (doctor) no actively use the system. Out of\u00a0this, you may manage the patient traffic.<\/span><\/div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\"><\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div><\/blockquote>\r\n<\/blockquote>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">2. Doctor (you) use system to issue Non-OPD functionalities such as issuing of Medical Certificate, Referral) -\u00a02 weeks<\/div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\"><span style=\"color: #ff9900\">This approach will train you with the system without making delays to your patients. With time you will understand\u00a0and realize how the\u00a0system can use for different use-cases.<\/span><\/div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\"><span style=\"color: #ff9900\">\u00a0<\/span><\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">3. Add Drug names (without stocks), Supplier information, and enter OPD visit information. (You may prescribe the drug as \"Phar\" since no stocks are available yet).-\u00a01 weeks<\/div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\"><span style=\"color: #ff9900\">This approach will also further train you with the system without making delays to your patients.\u00a0<\/span><\/div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\"><span style=\"color: #ff9900\">\u00a0<\/span><\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">4. Add Hint options to the lists such as \"Presenting Complaints, Diagnosis, Management, Ix to be prescribed\".-\u00a01 weeks<\/div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">This approach will be ready to go live. Reduce the time will take for a patient.<\/div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\"><\/div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">5. Create a new test patient\u00a0and make \"My Favorite\" drug sets which are commonly used.-\u00a01 weeks<\/div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">This approach will be ready\u00a0for fast drug prescribing<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\"><\/div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">6. Update drug stocks and ready for the complete system drive.-\u00a01 weeks<\/div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">This approach will be ready\u00a0for fast drug prescribing<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>","post_id":4547,"count":[{"05-11-2025":1,"2025-11":2,"all-time":18,"11-11-2025":1,"07-12-2025":1,"2025-12":8,"09-12-2025":5,"11-12-2025":1,"14-12-2025":1,"05-01-2026":1,"2026-01":1,"18-02-2026":1,"2026-02":2,"27-02-2026":1,"14-04-2026":2,"2026-04":2,"23-05-2026":1,"2026-05":1,"10-07-2026":1,"2026-07":2,"24-07-2026":1}],"excerpt":"","post_date":"2025-11-05 21:02:42","post_modified":"2026-07-24 04:13:12"},{"slug":"i-got-admin-credentials-to-access-my-docpp-account-how-should-i-start-then","title":"I got Admin credentials to access my DocPP account. How should I start then?","content":"Congratulations. You are now member of DocPP. Here how you can start the journey...\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\"><b>Step 1: <\/b>Create user accounts for the Medical center staff<\/div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\"><b>Step 2: <\/b>List down the drug details into a paper (DrugName, Dosage form, Qty on Hand = 0, Re-Orde Level,\u00a0 UnitCost Price, Unit Selling Price)<\/div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">- Add New drug names to the system ( in this case keep \"Qty on Hand\"as 0 in order to update them later)<\/div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\"><b>Step 3: <\/b>Add a list of supplier details<\/div>","post_id":4549,"count":[{"05-11-2025":1,"2025-11":2,"all-time":16,"11-11-2025":1,"07-12-2025":1,"2025-12":9,"09-12-2025":6,"11-12-2025":1,"14-12-2025":1,"05-01-2026":1,"2026-01":1,"15-04-2026":1,"2026-04":1,"23-05-2026":1,"2026-05":1,"10-07-2026":1,"2026-07":2,"24-07-2026":1}],"excerpt":"","post_date":"2025-11-05 21:07:15","post_modified":"2026-07-24 04:13:13"}]}];</script>
